     "src": "Spider Engineers",
     "y": 1956,
     "q": "p1a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Mateo makes his offer. Hand over the shipment, and Walter's family keeps breathing. Walter answers the only way he knows.",
   "see": [
    "a man in a cowboy hat at a ranch gate"
   ],
   "mood": "dread",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v09.wav",
   "d": 8.75,
   "e": "0wzywwvr0yywvup0zvvxxvkzr30zwxwuzxwxni00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/fa46dcdd-84b9-5716-9660-3855f719e66f/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/a297bdb6-acd3-5438-9ba2-1e216e673d3a.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 5.2,
     "src": "The Green Promise",
     "y": 1949,
     "q": "a man in a cowboy hat at a ranch gate",
     "fit": 0.366
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALTER",
   "text": "I taught civics. This is the only way I know how to threaten someone. Justice is each part of the soul performing its proper function.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v10.wav",
   "d": 8.275,
   "e": "0wzqzi0ywwzywyutxvui8zutuuxqzrxzmwuxo100"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MATEO",
   "text": "That sounds like a slogan.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v11.wav",
   "d": 2.2,
   "e": "0000qzzwhlxzxvszvqvnjsxywnslmme100000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALTER",
   "text": "It's a diagnosis. You are appetite. Your function is to take. To consume. To turn fear into profit.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v12.wav",
   "d": 6.65,
   "e": "0qxyyxwmeczwsvfwwttmuv0tyyzjrzqysnwn2000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Walter's partner, he says, is spirit: loyalty, bravery, and anger when necessary.",
   "see": [
    "a young man in a cap"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v13.wav",
   "d": 6.475,
   "e": "0vzyoyvu0zztqvwwb00zytytyxxqvyvwxstpd000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/road-runners/clips/0000428094-0000432332.mp4",
     "in": 1.5,
     "dur": 4.24,
     "src": "Road Runners",
     "y": 1952,
     "q": "a young man in a cap",
     "fit": 0.331
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "JESSE"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JESSE",
   "text": "Bro, I'm also like... sadness and stuff.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v15.wav",
   "d": 2.65,
   "e": "000rzzzyzwlyuut70gvytvrlsjduqb0000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALTER",
   "text": "I'm reason. My function is to decide what lives... and what doesn't.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v16.wav",
   "d": 4.675,
   "e": "00wzzzsrvsvvotpispwwqttzuhd0ezxoypg00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "somebody has to make the decisions",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/bff9a8c1-d960-5f3e-b40d-fae8319a77d2/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/3cc7f741-3331-53fb-9f1c-8b103988f262.mp4",
   "in": 17.93,
   "d": 2.1,
   "said": "You have an independent decision to make.",
   "src": "Architecture of Antitrust (Part 1)",
   "y": 1999
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MATEO",
   "text": "Reason doesn't get to play god.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v18.wav",
   "d": 2.5,
   "e": "0006vzxwvxwvzsxtwwlukhzxpuyvsqf700000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALTER",
   "text": "In Texas, everyone plays god. Some of us just finally admit it.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep06/v19.wav",
   "d": 4.825,
   "e": "00ywymvmvzzxqxurztf0bxyusqdzzurxxnb10000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Mateo says Walter is outnumbered. Walter steps aside. Past the gate is a narrow canyon, and the truck has stopped right at its edge.",
